  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "25146176",
      "title": "Setting Up The Core Pages",
      "lectureOrder": 354,
      "videoOrder": 326,
      "sourceHash": "a0921f23d9cd8e3b6723e6b1b796cec5ea23b6e90b74c1226cbd18349148d186",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.1,
          "end": 4.23,
          "en": "Now the question is how do we get started",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.23,
          "end": 5.69,
          "en": "with this project though?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.69,
          "end": 7.49,
          "en": "And there are different ways",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.49,
          "end": 10.13,
          "en": "it's of course, up to you, which approach you prefer,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.13,
          "end": 14.11,
          "en": "but I personally like to get started with my pages",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.11,
          "end": 17.04,
          "en": "that gives the project a general structure,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.04,
          "end": 19.51,
          "en": "and I can then plan my other components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.51,
          "end": 21.98,
          "en": "around those pages which we need.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 21.98,
          "end": 26.37,
          "en": "So I'll start in this pages folder and here for this block,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.37,
          "end": 27.88,
          "en": "we need a couple of pages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 27.88,
          "end": 29.72,
          "en": "We need the starting page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 29.72,
          "end": 32.37,
          "en": "which shows the featured blog posts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 32.37,
          "end": 34.93,
          "en": "and our little welcome screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 34.93,
          "end": 36.8,
          "en": "We need the contact page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 36.8,
          "end": 40.64,
          "en": "which shows that form users can fill out.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 40.64,
          "end": 44.2,
          "en": "We need the page for all the blog posts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 44.2,
          "end": 48.24,
          "en": "and we need the individual blog post page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 48.24,
          "end": 50.07,
          "en": "And therefore in the pages folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 50.07,
          "end": 52.35,
          "en": "I'll start with the starting page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 52.35,
          "end": 56.565,
          "en": "by adding an index.js file in the pages folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 56.565,
          "end": 61.565,
          "en": "Now in there, we can create our homepage component function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 61.79,
          "end": 65.95,
          "en": "and export that as a default here, like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 65.95,
          "end": 67.77,
          "en": "And I'll copy that basic code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 67.77,
          "end": 70.33,
          "en": "because I'll create functions in the same way",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 70.33,
          "end": 72.55,
          "en": "in the other pages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 72.55,
          "end": 76.22,
          "en": "And for example, in the contact page, we also need that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 76.22,
          "end": 79.26,
          "en": "and hence we can add a contact.js file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 79.26,
          "end": 81.34,
          "en": "here in the pages folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 81.34,
          "end": 83.68,
          "en": "Now you'll learnt that the alternative",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 83.68,
          "end": 85.8,
          "en": "would be to add a contact folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 85.8,
          "end": 88.11,
          "en": "with the index.js file in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 88.11,
          "end": 90.23,
          "en": "It's up to you, which approach you prefer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 90.23,
          "end": 93.97,
          "en": "I will go for the context for the contact.js file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 93.97,
          "end": 97.43,
          "en": "and just add my component in there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 97.43,
          "end": 100.813,
          "en": "the contact page, like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 102.18,
          "end": 105.97,
          "en": "Then we also have our posts specific pages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 105.97,
          "end": 107.93,
          "en": "And for that I'll create a sub folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 107.93,
          "end": 110.96000000000001,
          "en": "because there I'll also need a nested route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 110.96000000000001,
          "end": 113.14,
          "en": "with a dynamic segment.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 113.14,
          "end": 115.3,
          "en": "However, I'll start with a different page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 115.3,
          "end": 118.36,
          "en": "a different route, and that's the all posts page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 118.36,
          "end": 120.64,
          "en": "for this we could add a posts folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 120.64,
          "end": 123.53,
          "en": "and then an index.js file in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 123.53,
          "end": 128.16,
          "en": "And that page will then be loaded for requests targeting",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 128.16,
          "end": 132.43,
          "en": "our domain slash posts slash nothing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 132.43,
          "end": 137.43,
          "en": "So here we have the all posts page, like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 140.82999999999998,
          "end": 143.64,
          "en": "Then we have the page for a single post.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 143.64,
          "end": 145.49,
          "en": "So when we click on a post,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 145.49,
          "end": 148,
          "en": "the page that shows that single post",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 148,
          "end": 150.93,
          "en": "and that page is dynamic.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 150.93,
          "end": 153.573,
          "en": "It should have a dynamic parameter in the URL,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 154.53,
          "end": 159.53,
          "en": "which identifies that post, something like the post ID.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 159.59,
          "end": 162.81,
          "en": "And therefore we could add id.js file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 162.81,
          "end": 164.68,
          "en": "with id in square brackets",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 164.68,
          "end": 168.48,
          "en": "because you'll learnt that this sets up a dynamic page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 168.48,
          "end": 172.32,
          "en": "in next.js which is loaded for different requests",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 172.32,
          "end": 175.57999999999998,
          "en": "with different IDs in the URL.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 175.57999999999998,
          "end": 178.32999999999998,
          "en": "And we can then extract the concrete value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 178.32999999999998,
          "end": 180.78,
          "en": "that was provided for a given request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 180.78,
          "end": 183.43,
          "en": "from inside that page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 183.43,
          "end": 187.24,
          "en": "That would work, but I don't wanna work with an ID here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 187.24,
          "end": 189.23,
          "en": "Now, of course the identifier name here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 189.23,
          "end": 190.62,
          "en": "is totally up to you,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 190.62,
          "end": 193.434,
          "en": "but you should name it such that it reflects",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 193.434,
          "end": 197.05,
          "en": "which kind of value you'll extract.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 197.05,
          "end": 201.02,
          "en": "And I don't want an ID here because if we had an ID,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 201.02,
          "end": 202.94,
          "en": "if we do that for a second,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 202.94,
          "end": 205.31,
          "en": "then we would load a single post",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 205.31,
          "end": 210.31,
          "en": "for something like slash post slash p1, p2, p3 and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 211,
          "end": 214.69,
          "en": "If p1, p2, p3 are our IDs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 214.69,
          "end": 216.81,
          "en": "And whilst this would work,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 216.81,
          "end": 219.05,
          "en": "it's not very human readable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 219.05,
          "end": 221.69299999999998,
          "en": "and also not search engine friendly.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 222.53,
          "end": 225.86,
          "en": "It would be better to have URLs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 225.86,
          "end": 230.86,
          "en": "like /posts/getting-started-with-nextjs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 231.39,
          "end": 234.86,
          "en": "If our URL would look something like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 234.86,
          "end": 238.41,
          "en": "Now, this thing here, is called a slug.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 238.41,
          "end": 240.73,
          "en": "That's what we typically call a slug.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 240.73,
          "end": 242.96,
          "en": "It's also a unique identifier,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 242.96,
          "end": 245.79,
          "en": "we could call it a unique ID therefore",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 245.79,
          "end": 247.14,
          "en": "but it is called a slug",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 247.14,
          "end": 249.82,
          "en": "and it's basically a human readable sentence",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 249.82,
          "end": 252.99,
          "en": "without white space, without special characters.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 252.99,
          "end": 256.94,
          "en": "Simply with words separated by dashes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 256.94,
          "end": 261.94,
          "en": "And hence here, I want to extract such a slug from my URL",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 263.26,
          "end": 267.54,
          "en": "and I expect that I do get these slug identifiers",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 267.54,
          "end": 272.42,
          "en": "for the individual posts to have these human readable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 272.42,
          "end": 277.42,
          "en": "and search engine friendly URLs in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 277.58,
          "end": 281.79,
          "en": "That is then the single post page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 281.79,
          "end": 284.47,
          "en": "or the post detailed page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 284.47,
          "end": 285.823,
          "en": "However you wanna call it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 287.12,
          "end": 292.12,
          "en": "Now, these are the four main pages which this project needs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 292.65999999999997,
          "end": 296.95,
          "en": "Of course, definitely feel free to add more pages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 296.95,
          "end": 299.43,
          "en": "It's also your project after all,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 299.43,
          "end": 301.75,
          "en": "and you can enhance it however you want,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 301.75,
          "end": 304.11,
          "en": "but these are the four pages",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 304.11,
          "end": 308.373,
          "en": "with which I wanna get started in this project here.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
